<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 15:41:10 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>战争导致迪拜机场客流量下降 31%。其首席执行官表示其全球中心的雄心没有改变</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/war-knocked-dubai-airport-traffic-down-31-ceo-paul-griffiths-global-hub-ambitions/</link><description>迪拜的全球航空枢纽资格在今年的伊朗战争中受到了压力考验。尽管地缘政治波动普遍存在，但其运营复苏的速度表明这些风险可能不足以改变阿联酋在全球商业中的长期角色。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2286289706-e1788273846484.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 15:12:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/war-knocked-dubai-airport-traffic-down-31-ceo-paul-griffiths-global-hub-ambitions/</guid></item><item><title>苹果公司新任首席执行官约翰·特努斯 (John Ternus) 曾告诉 Z 世代“永远不要假设”他们知道的和其他人一样多——他说，思维模式的改变将推动你前进。</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/apple-new-ceo-john-ternus-told-gen-z-never-assume-they-know-as-much-as-others-mindset-hack-push-forward/</link><description>苹果首席执行官约翰·特努斯 (John Ternus) 分享了他在这家价值 4.6 万亿美元的科技巨头 25 年职业生涯中的思维秘诀：“假设你和其他人一样聪明。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2287305166-e1788274451846.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 14:59:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/apple-new-ceo-john-ternus-told-gen-z-never-assume-they-know-as-much-as-others-mindset-hack-push-forward/</guid></item><item><title>专家称，特朗普在委内瑞拉达成的“世界历史上最大的石油协议”带有“殖民任人唯亲”的味道，很容易破裂</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/trumps-biggest-oil-deal-world-history-venezuela-reeks-colonial-cronyism/</link><description>美国与委内瑞拉的协议将包括一家第三方石油运营商，并纳入 17 个成熟或未开发的油田。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2292080669-e1788218683990.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 07:11:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/trumps-biggest-oil-deal-world-history-venezuela-reeks-colonial-cronyism/</guid></item><item><title>安永为那些证明自己的人类技能在人工智能时代仍然很重要的员工提供高达 25,000 美元的奖金</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/accounting-firm-ernst-and-young-ey-100-million-investment-employee-bonuses-future-focused-human-skills-ai-era/</link><description>安永将赌注押在判断力和适应能力等人类技能上，随着人工智能改变会计行业，为员工提供高达 25,000 美元的现金奖励。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2170483216-e1788274114420.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 14:55:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/accounting-firm-ernst-and-young-ey-100-million-investment-employee-bonuses-future-focused-human-skills-ai-era/</guid></item><item><title>初创公司 Endorsed 发现，一半的远程 IT 工作申请现在带有朝鲜欺诈模式</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/north-korean-it-worker-remote-job-applications/</link><description>正如神话担心缩小投资领域一样，虚假求职申请激增。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/endorsed-founders-2880x1920-1.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 10:02:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/north-korean-it-worker-remote-job-applications/</guid></item><item><title>“我们预计数英里长的管道将被摧毁”：大约 40% 的大峡谷关键基础设施因山洪暴发而受损</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/grand-canyon-pipeline-flash-floods/</link><description>据大峡谷徒步旅行者和河流跑步者汤姆·马丁 (Tom Martin) 介绍，“公园已经用油罐车运水”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26243672106083-e1788272298838.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 14:22:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/grand-canyon-pipeline-flash-floods/</guid></item><item><title>索尼和华纳音乐起诉 Anthropic 涉嫌盗窃“数万首”歌曲，其中包括《我是海象》和《哈利路亚》</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/anthropic-warner-sony-music-songs-lawsuit/</link><description>音乐出版商要求每首盗版歌曲赔偿 15 万美元，并为每条删除版权信息赔偿 2.5 万美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289852391-e1788209792703.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/anthropic-warner-sony-music-songs-lawsuit/</guid></item><item><title>“五角大楼现在在某些情况下群龙无首”：陆军部长丹·德里斯科尔在仅仅 18 个月后辞职</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/army-secretary-dan-driscoll-steps-down/</link><description>罗德岛州参议员、前陆军军官杰克·里德表示，赫格斯部长正在“培养一种惩罚异议的文化”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26238703224020-e1788271403985.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 14:12:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/army-secretary-dan-driscoll-steps-down/</guid></item><item><title>油价重回 92 美元上方，通胀担忧导致美国债券收益率升至 2025 年 1 月以来最高水平</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/oil-prices-bond-yields-inflation-fe/</link><description>油价上涨加剧了通胀担忧，并引发了美联储可能再次加息的预期。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26239535601087-e1788271321318.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 14:04:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/oil-prices-bond-yields-inflation-fe/</guid></item><item><title>古巴学校重新开学，没有燃料，没有校服，教师短缺 27%，140 万学生前往教室</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/cuba-schools-teacher-shortage-blackouts/</link><description>学校在燃料、食品和校服严重短缺的情况下重新开学，而一些家庭则忍受着持续 20 多个小时的停电。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26243710240734-e1788270775152.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 13:59:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/cuba-schools-teacher-shortage-blackouts/</guid></item></channel></rss>